# Optional manual scan log for average_snake_positions.py (--log).
# Default mode does NOT use this file: open/closed comes from FITS
# shutter positions SH1POS…SH4POS (open≈5 mm, closed≈35 mm).
#
# Day presets (see average_snake_positions.py DAY_FRAME_RANGES):
#   20260806 → frames 301–889
#   20260807 → frames 51–last on disk
#
# Format: START-END  LABEL  SHUTTER
# Example:
# 51-55  background  close
# 56-60  snake       open
